Package: neuropsychmethods
Title: Reproducible Examples for Neuropsychological Test Interpretation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Project", "contributors", role = "aut")
Description: Documented teaching examples, numerical checks and accessible
    figures accompanying the project manuscript. Synthetic reference examples
    illustrate computation and do not implement clinical diagnostic rules.
